### 环境切换（默认使用 dev）
GET {{base_url}}/actuator/health


### 查询所有图书
GET {{base_url}}/api/books
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 查询单本图书（id=1）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 按作者查询（author=Craig Walls）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/author?name=Craig%20Walls
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 按价格区间查询（min=50, max=100）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/price?min=50&max=100
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 分页查询（page=1, size=5, sortBy=price, direction=desc）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/page?page=1&size=5&sortBy=price&direction=desc
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 创建图书（POST）
POST {{base_url}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "title": "Spring Security 实战",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 69.00,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 更新图书（PUT /{id}）
PUT {{base_url}}/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "title": "Spring Security 实战（第2版）",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 79.00,
  "stock": 12,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 删除图书（DELETE /{id}）
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/books/4
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 批量导入图书（POST /batch）
POST {{base_url}}/api/books/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

[
  {
    "title": "微服务架构设计",
    "author": "Chris Richardson",
    "price": 89.00,
    "stock": 8,
    "category": "编程"
  },
  {
    "title": "Kubernetes 权威指南",
    "author": "龚正",
    "price": 129.00,
    "stock": 5,
    "category": "运维"
  }
]


### 批量导入图书（通过订单服务的导入接口，事务回滚演示）
POST {{base_url}}/api/books/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

[
  {
    "title": "设计模式：可复用面向对象软件的基础",
    "author": "Erich Gamma",
    "price": 99.00,
    "stock": 10
  },
  {
    "title": "重构：改善既有代码的设计",
    "author": "Martin Fowler",
    "price": 89.00,
    "stock": 7
  }
]

### 批量导入图书（模拟某本书数据异常，触发回滚）
POST {{base_url}}/api/books/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

[
  {
    "title": "有效",
    "author": "作者A",
    "price": 50.00,
    "stock": 3
  },
  {
    "title": null,
    "author": "作者B",
    "price": 60.00,
    "stock": 2
  }
]

### ================================
### OrderController 接口测试
### ================================

### 创建订单（正常场景，库存充足）
POST {{base_url}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 创建订单（库存不足场景，应回滚并返回错误）
POST {{base_url}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "quantity": 999
}

### 12. 创建订单（参数校验失败，bookId为空）
POST {{base_url}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### 13. 创建订单（参数校验失败，quantity为0）
POST {{base_url}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}
